-------------

PIKMIN and NINTENDO are trademarks of Nintendo. GameCube and Nintendo
GameCube are trademarks of Nintendo. The pikpik project is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or approved by Nintendo in any way.

Where the documentation refers to "Pikmin", it does so to identify the game
